import json,re,sys
from pathlib import Path
root=Path(sys.argv[1]);data={}
CASES={
 'edge':('The giant stands exactly ten grids south','A level-50 Mage with Acid Spray faces an awake hill giant exactly max_range grids south — on the blast loop\'s excluded south edge. Acid Spray is the only live attack (20 mana blocks Frost Bolt). The original never counts the giant and finds nothing worth casting; the correction counts it at radius-scaled damage and sprays.'),
 'near':('Control: the giant eight grids south','With the giant inside the blast loop in both versions, both cast Acid Spray with identical targeting. The complete logs are byte-identical.'),
 'empty':('Control: nothing in sight','With no monster at all, both versions find nothing to do. The complete logs are byte-identical.')}
for mode,(label,explanation) in CASES.items():
 item={'label':label,'explanation':explanation}
 for phase in ('before','after'):
  raw=(root/f'{phase}-{mode}.log').read_text()
  entry={'raw':raw,'passed':'native-c/acidarc-252 finished: 1/1 passed' in raw}
  for tag,key in (('SETUP maxsp=','setup'),('DECISION ','decision'),('OUTCOME ','outcome')):
   match=re.search(re.escape(tag)+r'(.*)',raw)
   entry[key]={k:int(v) for k,v in re.findall(r'(\w+)=(-?\d+)',match[1])} if match else None
  seq=re.search(r'sequence=(.*)',raw)
  entry['sequence']=seq[1].strip() if seq else None
  item[phase]=entry
 data[mode]=item
html='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Ball and arc blasts never counted their south and east edges</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#f4f1ea;color:#253a3c;font:18px/1.6 system-ui}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:32px 24px}h1{font-size:40px;line-height:1.2}h2{font-size:24px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.card{background:white;border:1px solid #cbd6d0;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin:18px 0}.cards .card{border-top:6px solid #648e80}.num{font-size:34px;font-weight:750}select,button{font:inherit;max-width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #aabdb5;border-radius:7px;background:white}button{cursor:pointer;margin:14px 8px 0 0}button.active{background:#24685d;color:white}.summary{background:#e6eee6;padding:20px;border-left:5px solid #377367}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:13px/1.5 monospace;max-height:330px;overflow:auto}details{background:white;padding:20px;margin:20px 0}summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:650px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:30px}}</style><main><p>Recorded native Acid Spray decisions</p><h1>Ball and arc blasts never counted their south and east edges</h1><p>The Borg's blast loops ran from center minus radius up to but excluding center plus radius, so any monster standing exactly radius grids south or east of the blast never entered the scan. Acid Spray is scored as a player-centred cone with a ten-grid radius: a hill giant standing exactly ten grids south contributed nothing, and with it the only live attack the Borg rated the whole situation as not worth a cast. The correction makes the loops inclusive; the existing radius distance check already keeps grids beyond the radius out.</p><section class="card"><label for="scenario">Choose a recorded situation</label><br><select id="scenario"></select><p id="explanation"></p><br><button data-step="0">The situation</button><button data-step="1">The decision</button></section><div class="cards"><section id="original" class="card"><h2>Original</h2><div class="num"></div><p class="state"></p><p class="action"></p></section><section id="compared" class="card"><h2>Corrected</h2><div class="num"></div><p class="state"></p><p class="action"></p></section></div><p class="summary" id="outcome"></p><h2>What the controls establish</h2><p>With the giant eight grids south (inside the loop either way), both versions cast with identical targeting; with nothing in sight, both refuse. Those two complete logs match byte for byte, so the correction changes only the edge case.</p><details><summary>Experiment conditions and limits</summary><p>Native Human Mage level 50, depth 30, glowing constructed arena, the Attacks and Knowledge book carried, Acid Spray learned and the only live attack (20 mana blocks Frost Bolt at cost 40), full hp, seed 1000. The production attack chooser acts on its own filled target list; the cast is shown by its queued keys, not executed. This isolates the blast-radius scan, not full autonomous play; no damage or survival claim.</p></details><details><summary>Recorded native output</summary><h3>Original</h3><pre id="original-log"></pre><h3>Corrected</h3><pre id="compared-log"></pre></details><p>Canonical report: <a href="https://github.com/diegoami/neo-angband-tracker/issues/252">issue252</a>.</p></main><script>
const data=__DATA__;let step=1;const select=document.getElementById('scenario');for(const [key,c] of Object.entries(data)){let o=document.createElement('option');o.value=key;o.textContent=c.label;select.append(o)}
function decisionLabel(c){if(!c||!c.outcome)return'?';return c.outcome.cast?'Sprays the giant (cast queued)':(c.outcome.acted?'Acts without a cast':'Finds nothing worth casting')}
function draw(){let c=data[select.value];document.getElementById('explanation').textContent=c.explanation;for(const [panel,phase] of [['original','before'],['compared','after']]){let d=c[phase],p=document.getElementById(panel);p.querySelector('.num').textContent=step===0?`Giant ${c.label.startsWith('Control: nothing')?'absent':(c.label.includes('eight')?'eight':'ten')+' grids south'}.`:`${decisionLabel(d)}`;p.querySelector('.state').textContent=step===0?'Acid Spray is the only live attack; the cone reaches ten grids.':'The chooser queues its chosen keys.';p.querySelector('.action').textContent=step===1?`Queued: ${d.sequence||'none'}`:'';document.getElementById(panel+'-log').textContent=d.raw}
document.getElementById('outcome').textContent=select.value==='edge'?'The original lets the edge exclusion hide the giant; the correction counts it and sprays.':'Both versions agree in this control; the logs match byte for byte.';for(const b of document.querySelectorAll('[data-step]'))b.classList.toggle('active',Number(b.dataset.step)===step)}
select.addEventListener('change',()=>{step=1;draw()});for(const b of document.querySelectorAll('[data-step]'))b.addEventListener('click',()=>{step=Number(b.dataset.step);draw()});draw();</script></html>'''
(root/'replay.html').write_text(html.replace('__DATA__',json.dumps(data).replace('<','\\u003c')))
(root/'replay-data.json').write_text(json.dumps(data,indent=2)+'\n')
print('Open in your browser:',root/'replay.html')
